#: ../../source/product-overview/desktop-app-changelog.md:217
msgid "Desktop App Multi-View Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/desktop-app-changelog.md:218
msgid ""
"Mattermost Desktop App v6.0 introduces a new Multi-View Architecture that"
" replaces the previous fixed-tab layout. This enhancement introduces a "
"dynamic, flexible system where users can open, close, and manage multiple"
" views or windows, including any part of the Mattermost app (e.g., "
"Channels, Boards, Playbooks). This architectural update provides a more "
"customizable and efficient workspace experience while laying the "
"foundation for advanced multi-window and pop-out features in future "
"releases."
msgstr ""

